      en: ["Red rocks", "Northwestern Bulgaria", "Hilltop fortress", "Military history", "Photogenic landmark"],
      es: ["Rocas rojas", "Noroeste de Bulgaria", "Fortaleza en altura", "Historia militar", "Imán fotográfico"],
